  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square oil painting of a terraced pastel valley with a blue long necked dinosaur walking across it, hooded figures in the foreground, a pink dragon lying down, and a lone tower on a cliff, signed CRUMP 11.",
    "description": "A square oil painting on wood, signed CRUMP 11 at lower right. A valley of stepped terraces in tan, olive, lime and pink descends from upper left, with a small white tower on a cliff at the top left corner and outlined clouds. A blue and lilac long necked dinosaur with a white visor face strides across the middle. Three hooded figures with visor faces, in green, pink and lilac, stand in the lower half, one holding a white tablet. A pink and red spiky dragon lies on a ledge at right, and a pink and yellow figure sits at the top right. Thick black outlines over flat colour.",
    "impression": "Hooded explorers in a terraced valley, with a dinosaur passing through as if it were ordinary. The one holding a tablet looks like a tour guide or a surveyor. It is the most landscape like of the About Town set and the one with the clearest sense of a story about to start.",
